        "text": "For the crust, rub the butter into the flour and salt with your fingertips until it looks like coarse crumbs with some pea-size bits left. Sprinkle in the ice water, mixing with a fork, just until the dough holds together when pressed. Flatten into a disc, wrap and chill.",
